  "description": "Fuaran.DB — the dataset model: a typed, default-deny tree of what a data source holds and what may be asked of it (sources, tables, columns with a type and a classification, permitted joins, measures, row policies and limits), with its op vocabulary, named validators, a check of a transform pipeline against the model, seeding and drift against a reported schema, a canonical wire codec and an AI-tools surface. Opens no connection. FSharp.Core and Fuaran.Core packages only.",
